        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7168d6f0-ba98-3985-ac0d-a919d7ff4754",
                "word": "immutable",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e1a5b978-e036-480d-bbee-0c13ca700f7c",
                        "entry_id": "7168d6f0-ba98-3985-ac0d-a919d7ff4754",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "immutables"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be15350d-57e6-3020-afdd-ff1e19e88aa8",
                        "entry_id": "7168d6f0-ba98-3985-ac0d-a919d7ff4754",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Que l’on ne peut pas faire muter ou permuter."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bd2a7d0-8b29-4e4d-83d5-98be2aaa838d",
                                "sense_id": "be15350d-57e6-3020-afdd-ff1e19e88aa8",
                                "text": "Il serait bon de renvoyer à l’école primaire ceux qui nous rabattent^([sic]) les oreilles avec la notion d’une patrie immuable et immutable."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "84dfff4e-be59-367e-acca-c696147894ce",
                        "entry_id": "7168d6f0-ba98-3985-ac0d-a919d7ff4754",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualifie une variable dont la valeur est fixée une fois pour toutes à son initialisation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b379b20-4db6-406e-92f4-353808c645f6",
                                "sense_id": "84dfff4e-be59-367e-acca-c696147894ce",
                                "text": "Toutes les variables du langage Erlang sont immutables."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cfb9accd-1532-4b75-9565-6c650efc8543",
                        "source_entry_id": "7168d6f0-ba98-3985-ac0d-a919d7ff4754",
                        "source_sense_description": "Que l’on ne peut pas muter",
                        "target_lang_word": "unalterable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unalterable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "afca2a67-7fa1-39dc-be22-00ce7fa1d292",
                                        "entry_id": "b29a2d7e-223d-3bd4-8602-af09afc04137",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Incapable of being altered, or of changing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c7ee14d-385b-462f-b8e2-c0acdc6d2f14",
                                                "sense_id": "afca2a67-7fa1-39dc-be22-00ce7fa1d292",
                                                "text": "People of unalterable ideas still insisted upon calling him \"Sergeant\" when they met him, which was in some degree owing to his having still retained the well-shaped moustache of his military days, and the soldierly bearing inseparable from his form."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe8fa906-c136-47f8-a24b-192efe477d87",
                                                "sense_id": "afca2a67-7fa1-39dc-be22-00ce7fa1d292",
                                                "text": "... every statute in the Bible and in the law books is an attempt to defeaat a law of God—in other words an unalterable and indestructible law of nature."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da9ec36f-48dc-4ac4-b534-711aa35ee1bc",
                                                "sense_id": "afca2a67-7fa1-39dc-be22-00ce7fa1d292",
                                                "text": "For instance, we’d need to make one of the following assumptions: (1) that the system will be programmed with an unalterable goal preservation meta-goal, (2) that the training process would select for such a meta-goal, or (3) that the adoption of the meta-goal itself is instrumentally convergent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a5b82820-35ba-30a2-9def-88b5b4af7751",
                                        "entry_id": "b29a2d7e-223d-3bd4-8602-af09afc04137",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Irreversible, irrevocable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fccdb9f8-7929-42f6-a669-06ba2fd94711",
                        "source_entry_id": "7168d6f0-ba98-3985-ac0d-a919d7ff4754",
                        "source_sense_description": "Que l’on ne peut pas muter",
                        "target_lang_word": "immutable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "immutable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b4c7690-d348-3023-8178-890c540dc02b",
                                        "entry_id": "35aabccd-a192-34bf-8fbb-5bd507c76e03",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unable to be changed without exception."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d24e0bb5-1e7e-4303-9055-698e72e232cf",
                                                "sense_id": "7b4c7690-d348-3023-8178-890c540dc02b",
                                                "text": "The government has enacted an immutable law."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da206140-342f-49e6-af10-9b58e65845de",
                                                "sense_id": "7b4c7690-d348-3023-8178-890c540dc02b",
                                                "text": "Mutable as is our nature, it delights in the immutable: and we expect as much constancy as if all time, to say nothing of our own changeableness, had not shewn that ever \"the fashion of this world passeth away.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35f43de8-d30c-4d74-9971-a1e5f65c7c2d",
                                                "sense_id": "7b4c7690-d348-3023-8178-890c540dc02b",
                                                "text": "In the trustless cryptocurrency world, you can still trust the cryptocurrency community and its mechanisms to ensure that the blockchain contains an accurate and immutable—unchangeable—record of cryptocurrency transactions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bc11fa5-6dc7-3cb9-8761-8bcf813800af",
                                        "entry_id": "35aabccd-a192-34bf-8fbb-5bd507c76e03",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not able to be altered in the memory after its value is set initially."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ded8f80e-17b0-48e1-80b7-33eeba85adcf",
                                                "sense_id": "8bc11fa5-6dc7-3cb9-8761-8bcf813800af",
                                                "text": "Constants are immutable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "immutable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "baf8813d-2bd1-32fe-bba9-674500860d33",
                                        "entry_id": "26ae5d98-430d-39e2-aee5-1c4b2e16b38b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that cannot be changed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
